# LF everywhere, whatever a contributor's core.autocrlf says. `text=auto` lets git tell binary from
# text, and `eol=lf` keeps a Windows checkout from churning every line ending.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets, pinned so auto-detection can never guess wrong and mangle one.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.webp  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
